// Keyframed gesture clips. Track format: bone → [[time, rx, ry, rz], ...] (deg).
// `hipsY` is a pseudo track: [time, 0, dy(m), 0] for a vertical bounce.
//
// Axis reminder (model axes, bones have no rest rotation):
//   head   rz<0 nod down, rx tilt (ear→shoulder), ry yaw (+ = his left)
//   arm    rz>0 raise forward, R: rx>0 adduct / rx<0 abduct, L: mirrored
//   elbow  lowerArm rz>0 flex (0…145), ry = pronation/supination about the forearm axis (split 30/70 elbow/wrist)
//   NOTE: arm end-poses are generated by scripts/solve-pose.mjs (targets for wrist / fingertip / elbow)
//   spine  rz<0 bow forward

